title: "flutter-rebuild-direction-data: Measurements and Corpus for the Direction of Flutter Widget Rebuild Cost"
abstract: >-
  Device measurements from a Redmi 9T, the two widget corpora, and the snapshots the analysis starts from. The code is in
  flutter-rebuild-direction. Third-party code inside the widgets keeps its own licence
  (THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
